Z||000000||TRiAD||06-03-2001||12:53 PM||||OK, here goes...<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88_Fiero_GT_white_fs_custom_cropped.jpg">    <P>The pic is a photoshopped rendition (done from a completely stock car) of what I would like to do with the white '88 GT I hope to be buying. <BR>It's a completely custom front nose cone, IRM-style rockers, alloy fuel door, aluminum wing, color-coded trim, custom rear sail panels and 17" 5Zigen 5ZR wheels, in white. <BR>I hope you like it, this is an exciting project for me. It will be a blast to drive when it's done! <BR>It will have a V8, but I'm not sure which one (LT1, LS1, whatever...)<P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 06-03-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000001||Songman||06-03-2001||12:58 PM||||Looks pretty cool.. Just make sure you don't get a little too Cavalier-ish with the rear sail panels. That is kinda what it reminds me of in the picture... <P>You will definitely have a one off car...||||reg||14
