Z||000003||TRiAD||06-03-2001||01:59 PM||||Thanks Songman! I noticed the sailpanel thing, too...I'll have to be carefu of that.<BR>As for the nose, Jetro, I'll either have to fiberglas it (which I would rather not do) or find a way to do it in ABS or RIM. Flexibility is important for that part, and I hope to be able to retain that.<P>Thanks guys!<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> ||||reg||1
